  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Employers and Membership Organisation have effective leadership and governance system as well as a raised status of the Executive Council. Strong leadership will positively influence management and staff of the Secretariat due to the enhanced understanding of the links between stakeholder trust, EC trust, and high performance.  The EC will function with open discussion and better decision making. Confidence  will be  harnessed so that board members are eager to ask the right questions without fear of retribution. There will be  transparency and clarity regarding board function and management&#x2019;s function to avoid conflict and abdication.
With ILO support  EBMOs would have improved governance systems, strategies to widen representation and/or enhanced service provision.</narrative>
  </description>
